      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "nurse",
      "transcript_text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. BMI works out to 30.1, temp 36.9 degrees, weight 79 kilos. Blood pressure 131 over 78, respiratory rate 20, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, height 162 centimetres, heart rate 116.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:15",
